    "description": "A gaunt, blue-black hunter of the shadowed wilds with cold pale eyes, touched by the dark power under the Heartscar. Its pack dens in the gloom and grows every few minutes it is left, so a den found late is a den grown dangerous. Whoever clears one finds shadow crystal and gold in its den.",
